{"id":"a5d13298b5084be8","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-prop-elementary-equivalence.md","title":"Elementarily Equivalent Structures","display":"prop-elementary-equivalence — Elementarily Equivalent Structures","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-prop-elementary-equivalence","aliases":["58-prop-elementary-equivalence"],"display":"prop-elementary-equivalence — Elementarily Equivalent Structures","depends_on":["[[58-df-elementary-equivalence]]","[[58-df-structure]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-prop-elementary-equivalence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-prop-elementary-equivalence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-elementary-equivalence — Elementarily Equivalent Structures"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1b9a33135e67a903\" href=\"?note=1b9a33135e67a903\" title=\"58-df-elementary-equivalence\">58-df-elementary-equivalence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"58-df-structure\">58-df-structure</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B,\\mathcal L\\in V\">\\(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B,\\mathcal L\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElementaryEquivalent}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ElementaryEquivalent}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> is the predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1b9a33135e67a903\" href=\"?note=1b9a33135e67a903\" title=\"58-df-elementary-equivalence\">58-df-elementary-equivalence</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"58-df-structure\">58-df-structure</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}equivalence\\text{-}notation} \\vdash \\mathfrak A\\equiv_{\\mathcal L}\\mathfrak B\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ElementaryEquivalent}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B,\\mathcal L)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}equivalence\\text{-}notation} \\vdash \\mathfrak A\\equiv_{\\mathcal L}\\mathfrak B\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ElementaryEquivalent}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B,\\mathcal L)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}equivalence\\text{-}typed} \\vdash \\mathrm{ElementaryEquivalent}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B,\\mathcal L)\\to\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak B,\\mathcal L)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}equivalence\\text{-}typed} \\vdash \\mathrm{ElementaryEquivalent}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B,\\mathcal L)\\to\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak B,\\mathcal L)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}equivalence\\text{-}symmetric} \\vdash \\mathrm{ElementaryEquivalent}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ElementaryEquivalent}_S(\\mathfrak B,\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}equivalence\\text{-}symmetric} \\vdash \\mathrm{ElementaryEquivalent}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ElementaryEquivalent}_S(\\mathfrak B,\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The defining expansion lives only in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1b9a33135e67a903\" href=\"?note=1b9a33135e67a903\" title=\"58-df-elementary-equivalence\">58-df-elementary-equivalence</a>; this proposition records its notation, typing consequence, and symmetry without creating a second definition site.</li>\n<li>Elementarily equivalent structures satisfy exactly the same sentences of their common language.</li>\n<li>Isomorphic structures are elementarily equivalent.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-elementary-equivalence","status":"resolved","id":"1b9a33135e67a903","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-elementary-equivalence]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-elementary-equivalence","status":"resolved","id":"1b9a33135e67a903","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ElementaryEquivalent}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ is the predicate from [[58-df-elementary-equivalence]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Struct}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-structure]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-elementary-equivalence","status":"resolved","id":"1b9a33135e67a903","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"The defining expansion lives only in [[58-df-elementary-equivalence]]; this proposition records its notation, typing consequence, and symmetry without creating a second definition site.","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B,\\mathcal L\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ElementaryEquivalent}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Struct}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}equivalence\\text{-}notation} \\vdash \\mathfrak A\\equiv_{\\mathcal L}\\mathfrak B\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ElementaryEquivalent}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B,\\mathcal L)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}equivalence\\text{-}typed} \\vdash \\mathrm{ElementaryEquivalent}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B,\\mathcal L)\\to\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak B,\\mathcal L)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}equivalence\\text{-}symmetric} \\vdash \\mathrm{ElementaryEquivalent}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ElementaryEquivalent}_S(\\mathfrak B,\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)","display":true}],"bytes":1666,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3953","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-prop-elementary-equivalence.md|58-prop-elementary-equivalence]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["1b9a33135e67a903","d9b8711cda3f31ca"]}